{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10133120","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10133120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1013312001:1":{"text":"비석을 다 모았네요. 다들 수고하셨어요. 그럼 여길 봐주세요...","source_cn":"辛苦诸位收集石碑。那么，请看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECB5F3D1C86A9B38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013312002:0":{"text":"이 비석에 현지의 전설이 기록되어 있어요. 이걸로 성석과 신마 대전이 관련 있다는 걸 알 수 있죠.","source_cn":"这块石碑上记录着本地传说，表明圣石与神魔大战有关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC87208BEE8FF2FF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013312003:1":{"text":"이건 성당의 공식적인 표현으로도 검증된 부분이죠. 고증된 것은 아니지만, 많은 사람이 성석은 듀라 여신께서 남긴 것으로 여기고 있어요.","source_cn":"这也与圣堂的部分官方说法有所印证。虽然没有考据支持，但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9AF0AEB3123B2D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013312004:1":{"text":"맞습니다. 성석은 여신을 위해 남겨둔 보물이죠.","source_cn":"确实如此，圣石是为女神遗留下的珍宝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x246E54B30376E0C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013312005:1":{"text":"그렇다면, 여신의 보물인 성석을 왜 성당에 모시지 않고, 성석 마을에 남겨둔 건가요?","source_cn":"那么问题来了，女神的珍宝为什么没有被圣堂供奉，反而留在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1394A940348A770C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013312006:1":{"text":"좋은 질문이에요! 성당과 성석 마을 사이에 얽힌 이야기가 있는 것 같은데, 양쪽 모두 관련 기록을 가지고 있지 않아서 확실하게 알려진 바가 없어요...","source_cn":"绝妙的问题！中间似乎有一些故事，但是双方都没有记载，因...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8541F4DC41622C89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013312007:2":{"text":"우리는... <shk>으악! 골렘이에요!</shk>","source_cn":"我们——<shk>哇！是魔偶！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC37316562893895","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013312008:4":{"text":"<shk>지직... 탁탁......</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>嗞……咔咔……</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28D1E59420031743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1013312009:0":{"text":"다들 조심하세요.","source_cn":"诸位小心应对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FF7159EA3D25520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿斯玛":{"text":"아스마","source":"阿斯玛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"루시우스","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:魔偶":{"text":"골렘","source":"魔偶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"